    "sub_name": "深度學習",
    "sub_ename": "DEEP LEARNING",
    "describe_ch": "近年來深度學習已廣泛應用在人工智慧與大數據等各個領域，對於資料科學家為不可或缺之技能，本課程將並重深度學習理論知識的傳授與應用實作，藉由Python與TensorFlow，培養學生運用各種神經網路模型，建立深度學習程式的能力。",
    "describe_eh": " In recent years, deep learning has been widely used in various fields such as artificial intelligence and big data. It is an indispensable skill for data scientists. This course will pay equal attention to the teaching of deep learning theory and application practice, and train students through Python and TensorFlow. Training the ability to apply various neural network models for building up deep learning programs.",
